# B-334: Post-S-845 annotated uppercase patterns → Pattern::Constructor (not TypeTag).
# TypeAssert handles type-based dispatch; Constructor handles ADT matching.
# This test documents the current behavior: annotated patterns work with ADT constructors.
[
  Maybe: [type [Some value: Int] [None]]
  result: [Some value: 42]
]
=== out
Dict({"Maybe": Dict({"Some": Function(value), "None": Variant(Maybe.None, Null)}), "result": Variant(Maybe.Some, Int(42))})
